        <PPPCta variant="soft" utmContent="bench-press-power-output-mistakes-top" />

        <p>This guide covers bench press power output mistakes from a coaching perspective — based on 16 years of working with 1,300+ athletes at 5 Star Fitness in Scottsdale, Arizona.</p>

